<title>UK: UK's Blockleys sees difficult second half.</title>
<headline>UK's Blockleys sees difficult second half.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British brickmaker Blockleys Plc said on Wednesday it would be difficult to improve on last year's results if harsh market conditions continue for the rest of the year.</p>
<p>The company added that despite earlier optimism in the industry, the volume of bricks sold in the UK in 1996 was expected to fall below last year's total.</p>
</text>
